==Battleground==
*1 [[Zamelle]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Zroco]] spawns after 15.33 seconds<sup>460f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
No need for [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]]; all you have to do is bring any two Defense UP Combos ([[Little Warriors (Combo)|Little Warriors]] and [[Moby Dick (Combo)|Moby Dick]] are recommended to deal with the Zrocos), then use Lv.30 [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to get three hits on Zamelle. This will leave her with below 20,000 HP, where either [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] or a few [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]] hits + [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] can finish her off.

Le'Solar is not an issue at this point, just bring something to deal with her Barrier, such as [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fencer Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], and victory shall be yours in due time.

==Trivia==
*This stage is named after [[wikipedia:George Adamski|George Adamski]], a Polish author who purported to have met extraterrestrials.

